# A back-reference in the pattern is matched by nano. The editor does not support it (see
# docs/REGEX.md): it says so on the status line, and the cursor shows there, so this is pending.
pending: back-references in the pattern are not supported by the regex engine, on purpose
args: t.txt
file t.txt:
| abab abba
keys: {^\}
keys: {M-r}
keys: (a)(b)\2\1{Enter}
keys: x{Enter}
keys: {^X}
